New: TKLamp run limits (start at or stop below a lumen level, a time limit, and a no-readings timeout, 5 min by default) and a lumen grid on the runtime charts. Update the app without leaving it: tap Update, confirm once, keep using the app while it downloads, then Restart. Also TKLamp tester support through the hCRI ESP32 bridge: live lumens, Start/Stop run, and runs uploaded to Runtime on hCRI.io.
